# Choose your own file path, then run scripts/grok_client.py init --env-file YOUR_PATH.
# init has no default Cookie file location; leave its path prompt blank to set up later.
# Browser steps: README.md#get-your-x-cookie (DevTools > Network > Request Headers > Cookie).
# Console document.cookie cannot read the required HttpOnly login cookie.
# Paste the full Cookie request-header value from your own logged-in x.com session.
# Keep it on one line. auth_token and ct0 are both required.
X_COOKIE=''

# Optional explicit outbound proxy. Empty means direct connection.
# Examples: http://127.0.0.1:7890 or socks5h://127.0.0.1:7890
X_PROXY=''
